          "text": "Kepha obheka emthethweni opheleleyo wenkululeko, aqhubeke kuwo, engesiye ozwayo okhohlwayo, kodwa umenzi womsebenzi, lowo uyakuba-busisiwe ekwenzeni kwakhe.",
